silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_06_circuit_imprint_transport_sections_02_circuit_5_neurosomatic_anchor_concrete_anchor#bodilyfeltconnection silm:hasLongDescription "The BodilyFeltConnection is the bodily-felt connection between the chart entry and the actual patient. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'neurosomatic anchor', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
